1. Issue with Comments Inside JSX Attributes:
.Problem Identified: TypeScript and ESLint errors were caused by placing comments  inside JSX attribute values. 
JSX does not allow comments directly within attributes.
Error Messages: The errors indicated that the TypeScript compiler expected a ... and flagged the comment syntax within the JSX attributes. Specifically,
 it was pointing to lines where the title attributes contained comments.

